# Format on type

Typing the closing pipe of a table row realigns the table; Enter after a
checkbox continues the list, and Enter on an empty checkbox ends it.

inventory := table
| item   | count |
| ------ | ----- |
| pencil | 40    |
| eraser | 12    |

- [ ] Put the cursor at the end of this line and press Enter
  - [ ] Nested items keep their indent

<!-- Try: add a row | stapler | 3 | under eraser and watch it align on the last pipe. -->
